  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (16942-P001, 16942-P002, 16942-P003, 16942-P004, 16942-P005, 16942-P006A, 16942-P007A, 16942-P008A, Design and Access Statement. Received: 8th April 2013 ) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - \"Before the development hereby permitted commences the applicant must either:\r\na.\tInvestigate the site for landfill gas to the satisfaction of the LPA, to ascertain whether gas protection measures are required.  Where measures are required the details shall be submitted to, and approved by, the LPA.\r\nOr;\r\nb.\tThe applicant shall install gas protection measures as a precautionary measure without first investigating the site.  The details of these measures shall be submitted to, and approved by, the LPA.\r\nc.\tFor a. and b. all required measures shall be installed before the development is first occupied.\r\n"
